/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 40 0 R
/T (To design and develop an interactive Brick Breaker game using Python Tkinter that allows players to control a paddle using keyboard arrow keys or 'A' and 'D' keys, bounce a ball, break colored bricks, increase their score, and clear the board while avoiding letting the ball drop below the paddle. The game includes a graphical interface, score tracking, win/game- over detection, and restart and exit options.)
